# HELM Integration - Downloaded data and caches
# gcs_safety_cache/ was tracked by accident: 3,812 raw HELM JSONs, ~520 MB,
# roughly 90% of the repo's tracked bytes, referenced by no code (the scraper
# reads the sibling gcs_cache/). Untracked 2026-07-27; the blobs stay in
# history until a post-deadline history filter removes them.
helm_integration/data/gcs_cache/
helm_integration/data/gcs_safety_cache/
# helm_raw_data.json (9.8 KB) and helm_aggregate_scores.json (7.6 KB) were
# listed here but have been tracked since da98ec0 — ignore rules do not apply
# to files already in the index, so the entries were dead and misleading.
# Both are deliberately tracked: they are the inputs to compute_helm_power.py
# and the AAAI HELM scatter, and re-scraping does not reproduce them because
# HELM releases move under the same URL.

